  "use_case": "Use this minor treatment operational record when staff must document requested service and guardian authority. Reconcile qualified decision, consent limit, encounter result, and follow-up before the minor treatment handoff. Use the service request, minor and guardian identity checks, authority documentation, qualified recommendation, itemized consent, encounter record, aftercare instructions, and follow-up receipt. This authorization centers a minor, guardian or other lawful authority, a named treatment or procedure, qualified explanation, itemized limits, encounter result, aftercare receipt, and guardian follow-up. Ask the assigned minor treatment reviewer to confirm requested service against the organization's policy.",
